      "text": "[9:00p.m.] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nIt’s a smooth drive as you leave underneath the Oshodi Bridge through Brown junction, Bolade, Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD, Airport bus stop, National, Ikeja overpass to Ajayi Farm on to naa Ile-Zik.\n\nYou are rest assured that our Men are on hand to ensure good traffic flow.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
