    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1955002064893100144",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1955002064893100144",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1955002064893100144",
      "text": "[9:20p.m.] #IkoroduRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is quite fluid as you descend the Dorman Long Bridge inwards Fadeyi and move through Onipan, Palmgrove, Obanikoro, Anthony, Odiroko, Harbour works through the Independence Tunnel inwards Odo Iyalaro.\n\nTraffic on the service lane from Anthony through Maryland Mall adjoining Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way is good.\n\nTraffic is good to Ojota and the Interchange.\n\nOur Men are strategically positioned to ensure you have it smooth all the way home.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
